# Architecture

Always follow MVI with Clean Architecture.

## Layers

presentation/
domain/
data/

## Responsibilities

Presentation
- Activities and Fragments only render UI.
- ViewModels handle UI state and user intents.
- No business logic.

Domain
- Business logic belongs inside UseCases.
- Domain must not depend on Android framework.

Data
- Repositories coordinate local and remote data.
- Data sources handle implementation details.

## Principles

- Follow SOLID.
- Follow Separation of Concerns.
- Prefer immutable state.
- Keep dependencies one-directional.
- Reuse existing architecture.
- Avoid tightly coupled classes.

## State

Use

- StateFlow for State
- SharedFlow or Channel for Effects
- Sealed classes for Intent, State and Effect

Never expose MutableStateFlow publicly.